abstract: >-
  PBLang is a sovereign, multi-target systems, scientific, visual RAD, and
  quantum-ready programming language featuring a zero-dependency native runtime,
  self-hosted compiler, deterministic bytecode VM, cryptographic IP provenance,
  and multi-binary code generation across Linux ELF, Windows PE, WebAssembly,
  macOS/iOS Mach-O, Android DEX, 8/16-bit ROM, HTML5, and SVG targets.
keywords:
